abstract: >-
  Replication package for the ACM TOSEM manuscript Measuring Mechanical
  Reference Integrity in Machine-Consumed Instruction Files. Contains frozen
  observational exports, confirmatory audit summaries, exploratory RQ5 ledgers,
  protocols, and regeneration scripts. Science freeze date: 2026-07-03.
